WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:03.590
Script for KK OVA Ep3

00:00.000 --> 00:00.000


00:18.060 --> 00:20.390
If you turn me into a cyborg

00:18.060 --> 00:20.390
Kaizou suru nara

00:20.600 --> 00:23.060
install a self-destruct device

00:20.600 --> 00:23.060
Jibaku souchi wa

00:23.230 --> 00:26.770
as an option

00:23.230 --> 00:26.770
opshon tsukete kure

00:28.440 --> 00:29.570
If I

00:28.440 --> 00:29.570
Kimi o

00:29.740 --> 00:32.160
can't protect you

00:29.740 --> 00:32.160
Mamotte yarenai nara

00:32.320 --> 00:33.450
living

00:32.320 --> 00:33.450
Ikiteru

00:33.620 --> 00:34.740
has no meaning

00:33.620 --> 00:34.740
imi nai

00:34.910 --> 00:37.660
at all to me

00:34.910 --> 00:37.660
ore na no dakara

00:38.620 --> 00:41.080
Even if I had my erased memories back

00:38.620 --> 00:41.080
Kesareta kioku ni sae mo

00:41.210 --> 00:43.670
I wouldn't remember the two of us

00:41.210 --> 00:43.670
futari no omoide nai

00:43.920 --> 00:48.590
That's my one-sided and self-destructive love

00:43.920 --> 00:48.590
Sou wansaido jibaku no aisa

00:49.590 --> 00:51.550
I am still young

00:49.590 --> 00:51.550
Atara wakai

00:51.720 --> 00:55.010
but willing to exchange my life for yours

00:51.720 --> 00:55.010
Inochi o hikikaeshita tote kamawanai

00:56.180 --> 00:57.810
I'll become

00:56.180 --> 00:57.810
Kimi no

00:58.390 --> 01:00.060
your hero

00:58.390 --> 01:00.060
hiiroo ni naru

01:00.350 --> 01:02.640
If you are

01:00.350 --> 01:02.640
kimi ga akutou de

01:02.850 --> 01:07.020
kidnapped by villains

01:02.850 --> 01:07.020
saratte kureta nara

01:07.400 --> 01:11.440
You can upgrade me as you please

01:07.400 --> 01:11.440
katte ni kaizou shite mo ii ze

01:11.860 --> 01:15.450
[Elesa-Suimasen] presents

01:12.320 --> 01:15.450
Katte Ni

01:12.320 --> 01:15.450
Kaizou

01:15.870 --> 01:20.700
Second year student of Torauma High School, Katsu Kaizō is a cyborg.

01:20.700 --> 01:24.460
Attacked by mysterious people and left close to death with severe injuries

01:24.460 --> 01:27.590
he was turned into a cyborg by genius scientist Saien Suzu

01:27.590 --> 01:29.880
which saved his life.

01:29.880 --> 01:32.260
She brought along with her the underling Tsubouchi Chitan

01:32.260 --> 01:35.050
along with whom Kaizō continues his fight.

01:36.010 --> 01:39.510
Or at least, this is what he imagines.

01:45.810 --> 01:48.000
Oh no! I'll be late, I'll be late!

01:53.790 --> 01:55.400
Ouch!

01:55.400 --> 01:57.380
Hey, watch where you're going!

01:58.210 --> 02:01.760
You guys... Is this a Love Comedy?

02:03.370 --> 02:05.930
It's nothing like that! We just bumped into each other!

02:07.730 --> 02:09.800
Running into each other in the morning on your way to school

02:09.800 --> 02:11.380
is clearly something straight out of a Love Comedy!

02:11.380 --> 02:12.880
Go out, you two!

02:12.880 --> 02:14.750
Don't say weird stuff!

02:15.550 --> 02:17.700
What a great talent...

02:17.700 --> 02:20.700
A What Should I Do Love Story

02:20.700 --> 02:22.200
Sciencevestigation Club

02:23.120 --> 02:27.010
Chief, I've always had the feeling that we're lacking something...

02:27.510 --> 02:29.080
Now I know what it is!

02:29.500 --> 02:31.460
What are we lacking?

02:31.810 --> 02:36.100
I noticed it when I saw the underling suddenly bumping into someone else this morning.

02:36.160 --> 02:39.200
We are lacking love!

02:39.410 --> 02:41.590
What nonsense are you suddenly spouting again?

02:42.070 --> 02:46.740
Come to think of it, this series started in Shōnen Sunday as a Love Comedy!

02:46.740 --> 02:49.050
Now there's neither Love nor Comedy in it!

02:49.050 --> 02:51.680
So this started as a Love Comedy...

02:51.680 --> 02:53.610
What are the three most important elements of a shōnen magazine?

02:53.610 --> 02:55.600
Money, Rank, Fame.

02:55.600 --> 02:57.360
Jealousy, Grudges, Envy.

02:57.360 --> 02:59.110
Diesel trains, Control cars, Moya.

03:01.190 --> 03:04.670
Hey... could you take this seriously?

03:04.670 --> 03:08.300
Ah, it's "Friendship", "Hard Work", and something, right?

03:08.300 --> 03:09.870
Chief, you really are mature, aren't you?

03:10.080 --> 03:12.390
That's what they were in the past!

03:12.420 --> 03:17.460
Nowadays, the three most important items for shōnen magazines are (1) Love, (2) Love and (3) Love!

03:17.600 --> 03:21.660
If we don't support Love, who will?

03:23.200 --> 03:27.600
And that's why I've now put Love Enforcement Week into effect!

03:23.200 --> 03:27.600
Down with Dating Sims!

03:27.890 --> 03:29.060
What's that...?

03:29.150 --> 03:31.850
What should we do for Love Enforcement...?

03:33.180 --> 03:35.860
I shall lead you.

03:35.860 --> 03:37.460
Y-you're...

03:38.360 --> 03:39.860
Ravukage-Sensei!

03:40.500 --> 03:42.790
From the former Genius Cram School Drama Course

03:42.790 --> 03:48.130
The world-famous Love-Director of Japan, Ravukage-sensei!

03:48.210 --> 03:51.590
No one even knows how many prize-winning works she has...

03:51.700 --> 03:54.030
But it's said that whenever she takes on a story, it will turn to Love!

03:54.270 --> 03:59.260
I've seen all of your plays, Sensei! I'm a big fan of yours!

04:00.370 --> 04:03.760
The Fight Between Love and the Crab, The Love-Stealing Old Man, Throwing Love Away Mountain

04:03.760 --> 04:06.760
What an honor it is to be guided by you, Sensei!

04:07.150 --> 04:09.800
My guidance is strict.

04:09.800 --> 04:11.010
What are you talking about?!

04:11.240 --> 04:13.100
Don't just decide that on your own!

04:13.710 --> 04:18.340
Ravukage-sensei's guidance is famous for one extremely strict point.

04:18.810 --> 04:21.410
If she doesn't like you, she'll slap you with raw meat.

04:21.530 --> 04:24.810
What kind of Love is that?! Love of smacking someone in the face?

04:33.780 --> 04:35.310
What was that for?!

04:35.310 --> 04:37.250
It's sticking, it's sticking...

04:37.500 --> 04:40.340
You don't seem to understand the fundamentals.

04:40.600 --> 04:44.220
Wh... what do you mean? What are the fundamentals of Love?

04:44.520 --> 04:47.870
You're not pronouncing the "V" in "Love" right at all.

04:47.930 --> 04:49.180
"V!"

04:53.100 --> 04:55.390
The right way to pronounce a "V".

04:55.600 --> 04:59.290
Until you can do it right, face the wall and practice vocalization.

04:59.290 --> 05:04.280
"Love"... "V"... "V"... Why do I have to... "V"...

05:08.780 --> 05:13.370
So then, I'll quickly announce the roles! The main character, Ippei, will be played by...

05:13.370 --> 05:16.110
Tsubouchi Chitan!!

05:17.540 --> 05:19.070
Why is that?!

05:19.070 --> 05:22.450
He has a natural capacity for Love.

05:22.450 --> 05:24.210
This miserable guy!?

05:24.580 --> 05:30.890
Of course. The main character of a Love Comedy has to be a hopeless boy!

05:31.350 --> 05:34.280
This causes the readers to sympathize with him!

05:35.030 --> 05:41.400
Do you think they want to read a comic where a nice guy who's good at sports falls in love?

05:42.170 --> 05:47.950
The more of a failure a Love Comedy's main character is, the more they'll sympathize with him.

05:48.200 --> 05:51.990
"Why is this cute girl with that failure?"

05:51.990 --> 05:54.380
That is the point.

05:54.380 --> 05:57.700
And on top of this, aside from being a failure

05:57.700 --> 06:01.050
he has another feature that is important for a Love Comedy's main character.

06:01.510 --> 06:04.670
A Love Comedy's main character is a failure

06:05.060 --> 06:07.650
but he always has one singular talent.

06:08.300 --> 06:14.060
Possessing supernatural powers, being great at drawing, or having big nipples.

06:14.050 --> 06:17.600
A talent... There's no way that underling...

06:22.030 --> 06:23.570
It's railways, isn't it?

06:25.280 --> 06:30.020
That's right, ever since he was born, he's been a man with a thousand loves...

06:30.140 --> 06:33.580
I think he could even act as the Love God

06:33.580 --> 06:36.330
The Love God! That legendary role...!

06:36.700 --> 06:38.110
The Love God.

06:38.110 --> 06:42.340
A difficult role that is said to be impossible for a human to perform since he is a statue.

06:42.970 --> 06:47.350
A legendary role. It is said that only Ravukage-sensei can perform it.

06:47.660 --> 06:52.340
That role that many famous actors wanted to play but gave up on, you want to give to the underling...

06:52.750 --> 06:54.500
He is capable of it.

06:54.500 --> 06:58.320
I also am a petty actor, but I thought that someday I might play this role!

06:58.320 --> 07:00.340
Am I not good enough?

07:00.340 --> 07:02.020
For you, it is impossible.

07:02.280 --> 07:04.970
I'll try hard and become a failure

07:04.970 --> 07:10.520
I'll name a female character in an RPG after the girl I like!

07:10.520 --> 07:13.190
I'll pre-order the first-time special edition of a dating sim

07:13.290 --> 07:16.040
and even though I pre-ordered, I'll wait in line, too!

07:16.460 --> 07:18.290
Only he can do it.

07:18.830 --> 07:21.290
Is it even impossible if I start talking to a cactus?!

07:25.850 --> 07:27.400
I'm jealous!

07:27.400 --> 07:29.400
I'll stick pins into the tips of your toes!

07:30.050 --> 07:33.430
So, I have talent?

07:36.660 --> 07:40.670
Kaizō-kun, be careful how you speak to me from now on.

07:40.670 --> 07:45.020
Seeing as I'm a Love Star with a promising future...

07:45.020 --> 07:46.980
He puffs up fast...

07:46.980 --> 07:49.840
Now it's goodbye to this underling suit, too!

07:49.840 --> 07:51.700
So he always wears it as underwear?

07:52.480 --> 07:53.450
From now on I'll wear a...

07:58.070 --> 07:59.450
Love Suit!!

08:00.570 --> 08:02.240
He's all airs and graces already!

08:02.240 --> 08:04.580
So that's what being airs and graces is like...

08:04.910 --> 08:07.290
It's a bit soon for this kind of attitude.

08:07.580 --> 08:09.020
So, a lesson!

08:09.330 --> 08:10.550
Huuuh?

08:10.800 --> 08:14.800
And why do I have to take lessons from you?

08:15.070 --> 08:18.550
I'm a Love Star you know.

08:20.100 --> 08:23.300
Don't you want to play the Love God?

08:23.300 --> 08:26.940
Will that only be shown on cramped Japanese stages?

08:26.940 --> 08:30.900
I'm a world wide Love Star, you know.

08:30.900 --> 08:33.600
Maybe I should think about taking offers

08:33.600 --> 08:36.450
from Broadway or Hollywood!

08:36.450 --> 08:39.600
In this short while, he's already become this full of himself.

08:40.230 --> 08:44.160
Oh, come on, that's not it...

08:44.160 --> 08:49.950
Hey, Suzu-chan...isn't it about time to decide on me already?

08:50.810 --> 08:55.490
Oh, I forgot.  An airmail came for you, Chitan-kun.

08:55.490 --> 08:58.850
Hm? What could it be?

08:56.840 --> 09:00.100
I want you in my new movie. - Lucas

09:15.650 --> 09:18.370
I really am the only one that can play this role.

09:18.710 --> 09:21.490
Mom, stop wearing these outfits at home.

09:21.490 --> 09:23.000
Sciencevestigation Club

09:23.000 --> 09:29.200
Bu.... Bu... Love... Vvvv....

09:41.260 --> 09:43.520
It's the 7-5-3 season, isn't it!

09:43.520 --> 09:45.770
This is the time when they're the most cute.

09:46.130 --> 09:47.250
But soon

09:47.250 --> 09:48.890
they'll fall for dating sims

09:48.890 --> 09:52.000
or cheat on boys...

09:54.000 --> 09:55.530
Oh, Kaizō-kun.

09:55.530 --> 09:58.030
I'm scared...I'm scared!

09:58.030 --> 10:01.030
To Celebrate this Child's 7th Birthday

10:01.450 --> 10:04.050
What's happened? What's so scary?

10:04.050 --> 10:07.650
I'm scared of 7-5-3!! I don't know why

10:07.710 --> 10:10.790
but when I hear "7-5-3" I can't stop shaking in fear!!

10:11.040 --> 10:14.140
Oh my, why are you so scared of 7-5-3?

10:14.140 --> 10:16.550
Maybe something happened back when he was little?

10:16.750 --> 10:18.300
Something did.

10:18.590 --> 10:20.800
10 years ago.

10:23.480 --> 10:25.300
We're here, Kaizō.

10:25.300 --> 10:28.160
But Mother, I am already 7 years old.

10:28.650 --> 10:31.650
Is the boys' 7-5-3 not at age 5?

10:31.650 --> 10:34.500
That is a very big mistake!

10:34.500 --> 10:35.520
Eek.

10:35.530 --> 10:36.650
Reverend.

10:36.900 --> 10:42.160
All people have the right to hold a 7-5-3 to pray for their health.

10:42.200 --> 10:48.150
Great Genius Shrine

10:42.200 --> 10:48.150
7-5-3 Ceremonies

10:42.200 --> 10:48.150
53 yrs old

10:42.200 --> 10:48.150
35 yrs old

10:42.200 --> 10:48.150
47 yrs old

10:42.400 --> 10:48.160
And that is why since ancient times, we at this Great Genius Shrine have been welcoming a 7-5-3 for any ages.

10:48.560 --> 10:50.720
But isn't that just a normal prayer for health then?

10:50.810 --> 10:54.010
No, there is a big difference with 7-5-3...!

10:54.230 --> 10:55.610
And that is...

10:55.610 --> 10:56.760
The dressing up.

10:57.030 --> 11:05.150
I am sure adults regret that a three-piece with shorts and similar fascinating apparel are only for children's use.

11:02.190 --> 11:05.150
Model: Hiroshi

11:02.190 --> 11:05.150
(35 yrs old)

11:05.150 --> 11:08.280
However! Even if everybody has a right to celebrate

11:09.540 --> 11:13.760
that does not mean that everyone can reach the gods.

11:14.230 --> 11:16.150
What do you mean, cannot reach?

11:20.150 --> 11:24.170
Let me pass, let me pass...

11:24.490 --> 11:28.450
What is this narrow pathway here...

11:29.250 --> 11:33.460
It's the narrow path to the gods... Those without good reason shalt not pass...

11:33.460 --> 11:38.000
To celebrate this child's 7th birthday, I have come to dedicate my offering.

11:38.000 --> 11:40.110
Oh, is that so?

11:40.110 --> 11:41.590
Let us examine.

11:41.590 --> 11:43.220
I-I'm scared...!

11:45.790 --> 11:48.260
Ah, this is definitely a 7-5-3.

11:48.260 --> 11:52.980
If it were a 3-2-6 or 6-6-6 he would not be able to pass here even if he died trying.

11:54.210 --> 11:55.480
Pass.

11:55.480 --> 11:58.480
Kaizō, from here on, you'll go on alone.

11:58.480 --> 12:00.200
Huh? No way...!

12:00.210 --> 12:04.740
From here on, many trials will await you before you may pass through.

12:04.780 --> 12:08.900
I will slip through those trials and go dedicate my offering.

12:08.900 --> 12:10.550
Well then, go!!

12:10.950 --> 12:13.170
I'm scared, I'm scared!

12:15.580 --> 12:18.750
Don't think the trials of passage are over with this.

12:18.750 --> 12:22.410
Why would we let you celebrate 7-5-3 as easily as that?

12:31.520 --> 12:33.520
A girl is crying!!

12:34.670 --> 12:35.790
Hey, it's all right!

12:39.970 --> 12:41.770
Wait, Kaizō-kun, it's me.

12:42.150 --> 12:43.950
Umi-chan!!

12:43.950 --> 12:46.910
You were making such an unpleasant face, I didn't know it was you.

12:46.910 --> 12:49.490
I was also sent on a 7-5-3 trial.

12:49.820 --> 12:51.660
Let's go on together.

12:51.660 --> 12:55.430
I heard there are extremely frightening trials waiting after this.

12:55.430 --> 12:57.500
Extremely frightening trials...

12:57.910 --> 12:59.500
Singing without making the flame of a candle go out...

12:59.500 --> 13:01.380
Taking home the Golden Claw...

13:01.380 --> 13:03.130
Training in 100 times stronger gravity...

13:03.130 --> 13:06.130
Eating porridge without wetting more than 1 cm of your chopsticks...

13:06.130 --> 13:09.390
Getting your family together and saying "Let's Eat" 100 days in a row...

13:09.390 --> 13:11.560
It's frightening to even think about it!!

13:12.110 --> 13:13.510
Hey, Kaizō-kun.

13:14.200 --> 13:17.650
Are sideburns just called "burns" if there's no hair at the sides?

13:18.300 --> 13:20.900
What exactly do you think are "sideburns"?

13:21.370 --> 13:22.970
I just thought of it.

13:22.970 --> 13:25.050
There are many mysteries in life!!

13:25.050 --> 13:27.170
Fear my inquisitive spirit!

13:27.540 --> 13:29.500
Trial!

13:30.530 --> 13:31.730
They're here!!

13:32.080 --> 13:36.040
You have to be a child with a lot of patience, or you won't get any further than this.

13:36.400 --> 13:39.170
Let us test if you have enough patience.

13:39.450 --> 13:41.550
From now on we will have a chat.

13:41.780 --> 13:44.550
How long can you endure not butting in...?

13:45.200 --> 13:48.530
What was that spell called again, where you never know what happens?

13:48.530 --> 13:52.560
Let's see... it wasn't <i>Al Dente</i> and it wasn't <i>Andante</i> either...

13:52.770 --> 13:55.250
Ah, I know, it was <i>Biollante</i>.

13:55.250 --> 13:58.440
Oh yes, that's right, it's Biollante. You really have a great memory, don't you.

13:58.440 --> 13:59.940
But it's called Hocu...

14:00.610 --> 14:03.120
No, Kaizō-kun!! We'll fail!

14:03.120 --> 14:05.350
We're kids with a lot of patience!!

14:05.650 --> 14:09.620
Since we practice patience every day, using these methods is of

14:09.680 --> 14:11.370
no, No, NO USE!

14:11.370 --> 14:14.120
Practicing patience?!

14:14.370 --> 14:15.110
That's right!

14:15.350 --> 14:18.080
I resist drawing strange cubics while I'm on the phone

14:18.760 --> 14:22.250
and resist following one single fat globule in my ramen!

14:22.250 --> 14:24.240
Even though you're still a child...!

14:24.240 --> 14:26.260
It's not good to endure that much.

14:26.260 --> 14:30.010
I also resist splitting Apollo Choco into two pieces when eating it!!

14:30.340 --> 14:34.890
And I refrain from thinking about the past life of the kid next to me!!

14:34.890 --> 14:37.040
What, even that!?

14:37.040 --> 14:40.060
Holding in these kinds of actions is so hard that you wish you'd die!

14:40.310 --> 14:44.930
Even you, Master, can't resist putting the I-shape tetromino into a gap in Tetris!

14:44.930 --> 14:46.070
Don't say that!!

14:46.070 --> 14:50.660
We'll then, I wonder if you can endure this, my child!!

14:50.780 --> 14:56.030
This head I shaved this morning. Can you resist patting it!?

14:56.030 --> 14:58.790
I don't think she even wants to pat it.

14:59.090 --> 14:59.580
Right?

15:02.860 --> 15:05.340
Umi-chan is strangely excited!?

15:05.850 --> 15:07.760
P-A-T!

15:08.630 --> 15:10.340
No, Umi-chan!!

15:14.140 --> 15:17.700
Ah, it's no good, I can't resist!!

15:17.700 --> 15:20.310
I'm going to drown in the fascination of this rough feeling!

15:20.650 --> 15:23.480
Kaizō-kun, cast a spell!!

15:23.480 --> 15:26.320
A spell of justice to stop me!!

15:26.320 --> 15:27.940
I don't know such a spell.

15:27.940 --> 15:31.950
Ha ha ha, now you're at the limits of your patience!

15:31.950 --> 15:33.430
This is the decisive blow!!

15:34.160 --> 15:38.010
These are scabs I have all over my body that are just about healed.

15:38.010 --> 15:40.710
Can you resist peeling them off!?

15:42.260 --> 15:48.400
Scabs! Scabs!!

15:48.400 --> 15:49.460
Umi-chan!

16:06.690 --> 16:08.660
So... you peeled them off.

16:08.660 --> 16:10.110
You fail!!

16:12.610 --> 16:15.490
Peel them off!!

16:12.610 --> 16:13.790
That hurts!

16:13.790 --> 16:15.490
I said that hurts!

16:15.490 --> 16:17.700
H-Hey, you already failed!

16:17.700 --> 16:21.260
Don't peel off any more!

16:22.290 --> 16:24.000
That hurts!

16:22.300 --> 16:23.590
S-scary!!

16:23.930 --> 16:27.040
<i>With dead eyes she cold-bloodedly peeled off the scabs!!</i>

16:26.360 --> 16:27.010
No...stop!

16:37.410 --> 16:40.220
P-A-T!

16:43.140 --> 16:44.940
Hey, stop it!!

16:44.940 --> 16:46.600
Ouch...ouch!

16:46.600 --> 16:49.850
It's getting hot! It's hot I said!!

17:16.590 --> 17:19.160
And you really didn't see anything?

17:32.480 --> 17:35.570
There are men who challenge their very limits.

17:36.300 --> 17:37.990
Just 1 centimeter deeper...

17:38.710 --> 17:41.120
Just 1/100 second faster...

17:42.100 --> 17:43.660
Just 1 centimeter higher...

17:44.380 --> 17:47.310
There are men who challenge their very limits.

17:48.330 --> 17:51.340
The Triple Close!?

17:54.700 --> 17:56.850
<i>Just 1 centimeter deeper inside...</i>

17:59.920 --> 18:02.600
<i>Just 1 more millimeter...</i>

18:02.820 --> 18:05.850
The Japanese To The Limits Union. For short: JLS.

18:08.350 --> 18:09.850
<i>It's still possible...</i>

18:11.860 --> 18:13.360
<i>Just a little more...</i>

18:13.650 --> 18:14.010
To-

18:14.170 --> 18:14.530
The-

18:15.010 --> 18:16.450
Limit!

18:25.460 --> 18:26.860
Thank you very much!

18:40.200 --> 18:43.010
Don't you also want to challenge your limits?

18:47.180 --> 18:48.460
It's the limit!

18:48.460 --> 18:49.560
This really is the limit!

18:49.860 --> 18:55.450
The surface tension is holding it in somehow... but if I move just one more step, it'll spill!

19:07.750 --> 19:11.750
Ah... Aaaah... It's no... good...

19:17.510 --> 19:18.840
That scream...?!

19:18.840 --> 19:23.090
It's our beautiful and popular class-president Yamada-san again?!

19:23.320 --> 19:24.450
What happened?

19:24.450 --> 19:27.250
I was forced to challenge my very limits!

19:27.250 --> 19:29.680
I defended my yakisoba-bread to the last, but...

19:30.000 --> 19:32.200
Forced to challenge your very limits?

19:33.230 --> 19:34.220
That's right.

19:34.880 --> 19:40.750
Lately this neighborhood has had recurring cases of people being forced to challenge their limits...

19:41.690 --> 19:47.100
Their very limits, you say? As much to the limits as "Limit Girls” even if you can't make it to "Limit Chop”!?

19:47.100 --> 19:49.130
Stop talking nonsense!

19:52.500 --> 19:53.460
Yes?

19:53.460 --> 19:57.110
We set your cellphone to the limit for you.

19:57.110 --> 19:58.300
What do you mean?!

19:58.300 --> 19:59.210
Who are you?

19:59.720 --> 20:05.150
P...ase... en...y the fee...ng of li...ts...

20:07.470 --> 20:09.720
There's only one bar...!

20:11.550 --> 20:12.440
No matter where I go

20:12.440 --> 20:14.180
there's only one bar!

20:14.180 --> 20:18.250
Th.... i.... th.... li....t r....t?

20:19.880 --> 20:22.240
Oh no, it could be cut off any second!

20:22.240 --> 20:24.840
Wouldn't it be better if that call got cut off...?

20:25.300 --> 20:28.930
No. For Umi, who doesn't have any friends

20:29.030 --> 20:31.960
a cut-off phone call is her biggest fear.

20:31.960 --> 20:33.110
I see...

20:38.550 --> 20:42.780
Let's spread over the world how great the feeling of the limits is!

20:42.780 --> 20:44.440
Yes Master!

20:44.830 --> 20:47.880
Everyone in the world shall be at their very limits!

20:47.880 --> 20:50.270
Boys, be at your limits!!

20:50.570 --> 20:52.870
And thus, the incidents continued.

20:53.900 --> 20:55.940
My battery is at its limits!

20:55.940 --> 20:57.710
I can't save!!

20:58.640 --> 21:00.190
The paper reached its limits!

21:01.350 --> 21:03.550
This swimsuit is at its limits!

21:04.110 --> 21:07.540
Ah, mine is too!

21:11.200 --> 21:12.040
It's at its limit!

21:12.290 --> 21:13.440
Only 2 left...

21:13.950 --> 21:14.870
It's at the limit!

21:16.050 --> 21:18.890
The incidents are spreading more and more!

21:19.630 --> 21:21.740
Please do something, Chief!

21:24.340 --> 21:26.300
Should I lure them out?

21:31.630 --> 21:33.290
This is a game about limits.

21:33.770 --> 21:37.480
If these criminals love limits, they should show themselves for sure.

21:38.420 --> 21:39.890
Umi-chan, your turn.

21:41.650 --> 21:43.590
I don't think this will get them to come...

21:45.490 --> 21:46.610
They really came!

21:46.610 --> 21:47.700
It's the limit!

21:47.700 --> 21:48.870
It really is the limit!

21:49.150 --> 21:53.440
It was you, wasn't it? You're the guys responsible for all these limit-incidents...

21:59.980 --> 22:01.820
